  m_text: "Use the mouse to move your pharmacy technician around the pharmacy.\r\nJust
    click where you want them to go.\r\n\r\nPatients will come in to pick up their
    medicine.\r\n\r\nHover over the bags of medicine to find the right one for the
    patient.\r\n\r\nThe quicker you are at servicing the patients the more points
    you'll get.\r\n\r\nCan you clear the level with a perfect three star score?\r"
